pe to {name} Icon."},"illustration-slug":{"title":"Best {price} {name} download in PNG & Vector format","description":"Download {price} {name} Illustration that can be used in all designing software like Photoshop, Illustrator, Adobe XD and Sketch. "},"3d-slug":{"title":"{price} {name} download in PNG, OBJ or Blend format","description":"Download {price} {name} 3D Illustration that can be used in all designing software like Photoshop, Illustrator, Adobe XD and Sketch. "},"lottie-slug":{"title":"{price} {name} download in JSON, LOTTIE or MP4 format","description":"Download {price} {name} lottie animations that can be used in all designing software like Photoshop, Illustrator, Adobe XD and Sketch. "},"icon-pack-slug":{"title":"Download {name} Icon pack Available in SVG, PNG & Icon Fonts","description":"{name} Icon packs: Select from the wide range of {name} icon sets available in SVG, PNG, EPS, ICO, ICNS and Icon fonts. Download Now!"},"illustration-pack-slug":{"title":"{price} {name} Illustration pack from {category} Illustrations","description":"Download high-quality {price} {name} royalty-free Illustration pack available in PNG, SVG & EPS formats."},"3d-pack-slug":{"title":"{price} {name} 3D Illustration pack from {category} 3D Illustrations","description":"Download high-quality {price} {name} 3D Illustration pack available in all required formats."},"lottie-pack-slug":{"title":" {price} {name} Lottie Animations pack from {category} Lottie Animations","description":"Download high-quality {price} {name} royalty free lottie animations available in all required formats."},"contributors":{"title":"Our Contributors | IconScout","description":"Have a look at creative Designer Community of IconScout. We are proud to have their support and continuous efforts to make an incredible collection of icons & icon packs."},"contributors-hire-designation":{"title":"Hire {designation}s on IconScout","description":"Have a look at creative Designer Community of IconScout. We are proud to have their support and continuous efforts to make an incredible collection of icons & icon packs."},"contributors-username":{"title":"{name}\'s {designation} Portfolio","description":"{name} is {designation} from {country}. Explore their portfolio on IconScout to purchase high-quality royalty-free icons, illustrations."},"contributors-username-asset":{"title":"{name}\'s {designation} Portfolio","description":"{name} is {designation} from {country}. Explore their portfolio on IconScout to purchase high-quality royalty-free icons, illustrations."},"contributors-username-assets":{"title":"{name}\'s {designation} Portfolio","description":"{name} is {designation} from {country}. Explore their portfolio on IconScout to purchase high-quality royalty-free icons, illustrations."},"contributors-username-asset-slug":{"title":"{name} Bundle by {contributor}","description":"Download {total} icons from {pack_count} packs from {name} Bundle in SVG(Vector) & PNG(All sizes)."},"contributors-username-assets-slug":{"title":"{name} Bundle by {contributor}","description":"Download {total} icons from {pack_count} packs from {name} Bundle in SVG(Vector) & PNG(All sizes)."},"categories":{"title":"Browse All Categories | IconScout","description":"Beautiful, free and premium resources curated by our experts"},"categories-slug":{"title":"Download {category} {asset}s | IconScout","description":"Download high-quality {category} {asset} packs for personal and commercial use, available in SVG, PNG, EPS, AI, ICO & ICNS file types on IconScout."},"styles":{"title":"Icon Styles | IconScout","description":"Beautiful, free and premium resources curated by our experts"},"styles-slug":{"title":"Download {style} Icons | IconScout","description":"Download high-quality {style} icon packs for personal and commercial use, available in SVG, PNG, EPS, AI, ICO & ICNS file types on IconScout."},"icon-styles":{"title":"Icon Styles - Doodle, Sticker, Line, Flat, Gradient, Glyph, and More - IconScout","description":"Over {icons_count} icons in tons of styles. Get colored outline, doodle, dual tone, flat, glyph, gradient, isometric, line, rounded, or sticker icons at IconScout."},"icon-styles-slug":{"title":"Download {style} Icons | IconScout","description":"Download high-quality {style} icon packs for personal and commercial use, available in SVG, PNG, EPS, AI, ICO & ICNS file types on IconScout."},"collections":{"title":"IconScout Featured Collections","description":"Best collection of Icons, illustrations, 3D assets, and lottie animations curated for you. Available in all formats."},"collections-slug-assets":{"title":"{name} Collection Available In All Formats | IconScout","description":"Pick your favorite asset from  {name} collection and download in the available format."},"bundles":{"title":"Top Icon Bundles | IconScout","description":"Now download high quality icon bundles containing thousands of icon in 30+ different categories"},"bundles-slug":{"title":"{name} Bundle | IconScout","description":"Download {name} icon bundle containing {pack_count} different icon packs in SVG, PNG, EPS and many more."},"pricing":{"title":"IconScout Pricing and Plans – Individual and Team Plans","description":"Get Unlimited Access to {assets_count} illustrations, 3D illustrations, icons and Lottie animations with an IconScout plan. Browse our pricing and plans for Individual and Team Plans."},"plans-and-pricing":{"title":"IconScout Pricing and Plans – Individual and Team Plans","description":"Get Unlimited Access to {assets_count} illustrations, 3D illustrations, icons and Lottie animations with an IconScout plan. Browse our pricing and plans for Individual and Team Plans."},"plugins":{"title":"IconScout Plugins and Apps for your favorite Design Tools & Integrations","description":"Get access to {assets_count} design assets right within your favorite design tools. The IconScout plugin integrates seamlessly with Figma, Canva, Adobe XD, WordPress and more"},"download":{"title":"Free Dow