livered via IconScout CDN, Unicons ensures a seamless integration process, with SVG icons that are easy to customize and perfect for any project."},{"question":"Can I use Unicons in React, Vue, or other frameworks?","answer":"Yes! Unicons can be easily used in popular frameworks like React, Vue, and Angular by importing the IconScout CDN link into your main project file. This allows you to integrate high-quality SVG icons quickly and efficiently."}]},"monochrome":{"name":"Monochrome","slug":"monochromes","hero":{"title":"{query} Icon Fonts - Monochrome Interface Icons","description":"Explore a world of timeless allure with IconScout\'s {query} collection of monochrome interface icons. These icon fonts - Unicons transcend trends, embodying an ageless aesthetic that adds a touch of nostalgia to modern design."},"meta":{"title":"{query} Monochrome Icon Fonts - Download in SVG, Font, Vue, React | Unicons by IconScout","description":"Enhance your designs with {query} monochrome font icons. Use these font icons to create elegant UI designs, sophisticated prints, and more - Unicons by IconScout."},"item":{"hero":{"title":"{query} Monochrome Icon Font","description":"Explore exclusive {query} monochrome interface icons at IconScout. Unicons offer a diverse selection of icons for Web, App, and more. Download as SVG or copy code for Font, Vue, React, and more. Access a variety of customizable icons in the {category} category."},"meta":{"title":"{query} Monochrome Icon Font - Download in SVG, Font, Vue, React | Unicons by IconScout","description":"Discover exclusive {query} monochrome interface icons at IconScout. Explore our {category} collection of Unicons and SVG icons, perfect for UI designs. Compatible with Web, iOS, and Android."}},"get_started":{"hero":{"title":"Integrate Monochrome Unicons with IconScout CDN – Sleek and Simple Icons","description":"Bring a consistent look to your design projects with Monochrome Unicons. Use IconScout CDN for seamless integration, fast 